\[
(S - 3) + (5S - 3) = 30
\]

Simplifying the equation:

\[
S - 3 + 5S - 3 = 30
\]

\[
6S - 6 = 30
\]

Adding 6 to both sides:

\[
6S = 36
\]

Dividing both sides by 6:

\[
S = 6
\]

So, the son is currently 6 years old old.




