\[
\sum_{1 \le j < i} \frac{1}{2^{i + j}} = \sum_{i=1}^\infty \sum_{j=1}^{i-1} \frac{1}{2^{i + j}}.
\]
We can interchange the order of summation to get
\[
\sum_{i=1}^\infty \sum_{j=1}^{i-1} \frac{1}{2^{i + j}} = \sum_{i=1}^\infty \frac{i-1}{2^i}.
\]
