answer:  Given that the polynomial \( P(x) = x^{2017} + Ax + B \) is divisible by \( (x + 1)^2 \), we can use the fact that if \( P(x) \) is divisible by \( (x + 1)^2 \), then \( P(-1) = 0 \).

